    {
      "handle": "mmontemurro.bsky.social",
      "author": "Meghan Montemurro",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "Chicago Tribune",
      "text": "Among Cubs’ 5 Gold Glove finalists, CF Pete Crow-Armstrong & 3B Alex Bregman win NL GG award at respective positions. Brewers LF Jackson Chourio prevented Ian Happ from winning 5th straight, Dbacks RF Corbin Carroll & SS Geraldo Perdomo take it over Seiya Suzuki & Dansby Swanson",
      "likes": 31,
      "reposts": 1,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-02T02:26:01.204Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:nbtbg72x4ai35yy2mmx4o2mb/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzcbiyy4as2g",
      "jp_players": [
        "Seiya Suzuki",
        "Suzuki"
      ],
      "jp": "カブスのGG最終候補5人のうち、CFピート・クロウ＝アームストロングと3Bアレックス・ブレグマンがNLの各ポジションで受賞。ブルワーズLFジャクソン・チョウリオがイアン・ハップの5年連続を阻止。DバックスRFコービン・キャロルとSSヘラルド・ペルドモが鈴木誠也とダンズビー・スワンソンを抑えて受賞"
    },
    {
      "handle": "bastianmlb.bsky.social",
      "author": "Jordan Bastian",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "No surprise here: Cubs star Pete Crow-Armstrong is one of top three votegetters for NL MVP, along with Shohei Ohtani and Brice Turang. The annual BBWAA award winner will be revealed on Nov. 12. PCA led MLB with a 10.6 fWAR -- 2nd-highest mark in a season in Cubs history (11.0 by Hornsby in 1929).",
      "likes": 18,
      "reposts": 0,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-02T23:07:40.301Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:rcetk47n6hybe57ou4m36jf6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzegvatyr22h",
      "jp_players": [
        "Shohei Ohtani",
        "Ohtani"
      ],
      "jp": "驚きはなし：カブスのスター、ピート・クロウ＝アームストロングが大谷翔平、ブライス・トゥラングとともにNLMVP投票の上位3人に入った。BBWAAの年間表彰は11月12日に発表。PCAはMLB最多の10.6 fWARで、カブス史上歴代2位のシーズン成績（1位は1929年ホーンスビーの11.0）"
    },
    {
      "handle": "bastianmlb.bsky.social",
      "author": "Jordan Bastian",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Per MLB.com's Mark Feinsand, Seiya Suzuki received a 1-year, $23.15M Qualifying Offer from the Cubs. More info on QO's in here: www.mlb.com/glossary/tra...",
      "likes": 12,
      "reposts": 3,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-02T21:47:16.796Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:rcetk47n6hybe57ou4m36jf6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzecfisdn22j",
      "jp_players": [
        "Seiya Suzuki",
        "Suzuki"
      ],
      "jp": "MLB.comのマーク・ファインサンドによると、鈴木誠也はカブスから1年2315万ドルのクオリファイングオファーを受け取った"
    },
    {
      "handle": "timstebbins.bsky.social",
      "author": "Tim Stebbins",
      "team": "ガーディアンズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Tanner Bibee has won the AL Gold Glove Award at pitcher. Second Cleveland pitcher to win the honor, joining Shane Bieber in 2022.",
      "likes": 63,
      "reposts": 8,
      "replies": 6,
      "at": "2026-11-02T01:45:35.788Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:jrwmzzblbtbegomwff262gv4/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzc7apw6z22m",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Well, this is awkward.",
          "likes": 4,
          "author": "medi-nerd.com"
        },
        {
          "text": "Self defense",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "solana77.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Out of curiosity, as I think this might be an excellent bar trivia question someday, until now, has a pitcher ever led the league in losses and won a gold glove in the same year?",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "seahawkjake.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "If only he’d gotten more offensive support…",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "akronism.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "タナー・ビービーが投手部門でAL・ゴールドグラブ賞を受賞。クリーブランドの投手では2022年のシェーン・ビーバーに続き2人目"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "This could be something for later in the offseason, but I'd expect Myles Straw to remain an option for the #BlueJays if there's a role. Straw has strong feelings about the organization and I haven't been around many players who were as well-liked by their teammates and coaches.",
      "likes": 61,
      "reposts": 5,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-11-02T22:55:57.684Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzegacrud22m",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "オフの後半の話かもしれないが、役割があればマイルズ・ストローはブルージェイズの選択肢であり続けると見ている。球団への思い入れが強く、これほどチームメートやコーチに慕われた選手はそういない"
    },
    {
      "handle": "jasonbeck.bsky.social",
      "author": "Jason Beck",
      "team": "タイガース",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Dillon Dingler has won the AL Gold Glove award at catcher, again. He joins Iván Rodríguez (2006-07), Lance Parrish (1983-85) and Bill Freehan (1965-69) as Tigers catchers to win back-to-back Gold Gloves.",
      "likes": 53,
      "reposts": 9,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-11-02T01:42:53.444Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:ug2irz5m3k7nlbpiggqc73wt/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzc73v3tx22l",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ディロン・ディングラーが捕手部門でAL・ゴールドグラブ賞を連続受賞。タイガースの捕手で連続受賞は、イバン・ロドリゲス（2006-07年）、ランス・パリッシュ（1983-85年）、ビル・フリーハン（1965-69年）に並んだ"
    },
    {
      "handle": "timstebbins.bsky.social",
      "author": "Tim Stebbins",
      "team": "ガーディアンズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Heck of a year for Parker Messick, who's also an AL Rookie of the Year Award finalist with Kevin McGonigle and Payton Tolle.",
      "likes": 47,
      "reposts": 7,
